#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:51
msgid "Works with CommonJS, AMD and browser globals, through UMD."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:54
msgid "Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:57
msgid "`sourceMappingURL.getFrom(code)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:59
msgid ""
"Returns the url of the sourceMappingURL comment in `code`. Returns `null`"
" if there is no such comment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:62
msgid "`sourceMappingURL.existsIn(code)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:64
msgid ""
"Returns `true` if there is a sourceMappingURL comment in `code`, or "
"`false` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:67
msgid "`sourceMappingURL.removeFrom(code)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:69
msgid ""
"Removes the sourceMappingURL comment in `code`. Does nothing if there is "
"no such comment. Returns the updated `code`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:72
msgid "`sourceMappingURL.insertBefore(code, string)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:74
msgid ""
"Inserts `string` before the sourceMappingURL comment in `code`. Appends "
"`string` to `code` if there is no such comment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:77
msgid ""
"Lets you append something to a file without worrying about burying the "
"sourceMappingURL comment (by keeping it at the end of the file)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:80
msgid "`sourceMappingURL.regex`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/source-map-url_readme.md:82
msgid ""
"The regex that is used to match sourceMappingURL comments. It matches "
"both `//` and `/**/` comments, thus supporting both JavaScript and CSS."
msgstr ""

